Janis Papanagnou wrote:
> Tudor wrote:
> > Hi,
> > I've just started playing nethack recently, and was wondering how I
> > could tame more pets, and how to polymorph into different things.
>
> Taming:
> Throw tripe to dogs and cats, throw herbs to horses.
> Read non-cursed scrolls of taming or cast spell of charm monster
> while monsters are adjacent.
> Apply a blessed figurine.
> (Some other ways are too dangerous for a newbie.)

Magic harps don't seem dangerous to a newbie.  Magic traps probably
are.

>
> Polymorph:
> Zap wand of polymorph or cast spell of polymorph at objects,
> monsters, or self
> Jump onto a polymorph trap.
> Eat or feed to your pet a chameleon (or a doppelganger) corpse.
> Put on a ring of polymorph (only recommended with polymorph control).

Polycontrol or appropriate dragon scale mail is recommended for all
means of polymorphing oneself.  It's worth noting that with a magic
whistle, a polymorph trap becomes a very good way to repeatedly
polymorph your pet until it becomes something worthwile.  Titans and
purple worms are certainly attainable this way; not sure about
balrogs.  Archons aren't.



